# 🧱 Stack Overflown

A developer-themed puzzle game that fuses **Tetris-style falling blocks** with **pattern-matching mechanics**. Instead of clearing horizontal lines, you stack falling "code blocks" to recreate 5×5 error patterns — such as *Null Pointer*, *Race Condition*, or *Infinite Loop* — before your stack overflows the board.

