## Contributing

Contributions are welcome. Suggested workflow:

1. Fork the repository
2. Create a feature branch (`git checkout -b feature/partial-clear`)
3. Make your changes, keeping functions small and side-effect-scoped as in the existing style
4. Test manually in-browser (no test suite currently exists — consider adding one!)
5. Open a pull request describing the change and rationale

